      "Table 8 gives BZX84-C2V7 working-voltage limits of 2.50 V minimum and 2.90 V maximum at IZ = 5 mA. The minimum value was retained as the exact breakdown-voltage/current pair; no midpoint or nominal value was interpolated.",
